    itemInfo: An unsent letter of Admiral Hold filing for divorce from his wife,
      Theodosia. The letter is dated the day before his death. It states that Theodosia
      has been unfaithful.
  - itemName: 9
    itemIcon: {fileID: 5833068987551211288, guid: cde08ab5d1495014aa8faa779e317d83, type: 3}
    isEvidence: 1
    itemInfo: A note from Theodosia to Charles requesting he refrain from dismissing
      the maid and the stable hand in spite of their "scandalous actions."
